Changes: character readings and 2–4 character words were extracted from
jyut6ping3.chars.dict.yaml and jyut6ping3.words.dict.yaml. Frequencies come
from essay-cantonese.txt. A short list of orthographic variants (為/爲, 裡/裏,
著/着, 羣/群, 綫/線, 峯/峰, 眾/衆, 說/説, 戶/户, 啟/啓, 恆/恒, 溫/温, 哋/地)
is used only when looking up a frequency. The displayed spelling stays the
dictionary form. Words not in the essay list have frequency 0.

words.hk dictionary data was not included. Its licence is the Non-Commercial
Open Data License / CC BY-NC. jyut6ping3.maps (ODbL) was not included.

The application code in this repository is separate from the lexicon.
